; Install from the public registry.
;
; GoDaddy Node.js Hosting runs its own `npm install` on upload, and a lockfile
; carrying a private or proxied registry URL fails there with an auth error
; (E401) that reads like a broken package rather than a wrong source. Pinning
; the registry here keeps the platform's install pointed somewhere it can
; actually reach, and costs nothing anywhere else.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
